#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:1
#: 0d85a36071474a579293a659a94074a6
msgid "实验追踪与配置归档"
msgstr "Experiment Tracking and Configuration Archiving"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:3
#: a5b60f17e5a240d0890fe82bdd984121
msgid ""
"本指南介绍 UniKT 的实验追踪与元数据无损归档体系，包括如何配置 SwanLab "
"云端及本地看板、如何使用飞书通知接收训练预警，以及如何利用生成的 `run_config.yaml` 与 `run_metadata.yaml` "
"实现实验的严格可复现。"
msgstr ""
"This guide introduces UniKT's experiment tracking and lossless metadata "
"archiving system, detailing how to configure SwanLab cloud and local "
"dashboards, set up Feishu/Lark alerts, and leverage `run_config.yaml` and"
" `run_metadata.yaml` for strict experiment reproducibility."

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:5
#: 61e14f632f5a4ff18932eec4a0b68293
msgid "目标与适用场景"
msgstr "Objectives & Use Cases"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:7
#: 3fef66bfdb7b4e889510ab5a3147a0e6
msgid "实时监控模型训练过程中的训练损失、验证损失以及各项验证性能指标。"
msgstr ""
"Monitor training loss, validation loss, and validation metrics in real "
"time throughout training."

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:8
#: 9626d8d32afe4bec9ea44e85db1f2376
msgid "跟踪硬件资源消耗情况（GPU 显存占用、利用率）。"
msgstr "Track hardware resource consumption (GPU memory allocation, utilization)."

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:9
#: fd72d06e52dd4c31984ad0ab2082cb4a
msgid "配置离线/局域网私有化部署模式或直接关闭云端上报。"
msgstr ""
"Configure offline/LAN private deployments or completely disable cloud "
"telemetry."

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:10
#: 94fb40645fc84840960ceb8887e46ed3
msgid "保证每一次实验的配置完全自包含、可追溯并可一键复现。"
msgstr ""
"Ensure every experiment configuration is fully self-contained, auditable,"
" and reproducible with a single command."

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:12
#: 548ecedd36e047b18e11665f00eb0133
msgid "前置条件"
msgstr "Prerequisites"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:14
#: 66f3b55165a4413b9a1166fd73600594
msgid "**环境准备**：已进入 Pixi 环境（SwanLab 依赖已内置安装）。"
msgstr ""
"**Environment**: Pixi environment activated (SwanLab dependencies pre-"
"installed)."

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:15
#: 21a2b06616b6417c9bd48197cb27d021
msgid "**环境变量文件**：在仓库根目录下基于 `.env.example` 复制生成 `.env` 文件："
msgstr ""
"**Environment Variables File**: Copy `.env.example` in the repository "
"root to create `.env`:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:16
#: 9c8f8a043d8448a99b3612a80b4cd7b7
msgid "cp .env.example .env\n"
msgstr "cp .env.example .env\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:20
#: d656d9b0abfd49388d2264650d751ced
msgid "SwanLab 实验追踪配置"
msgstr "SwanLab Experiment Tracking Configuration"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:22
#: f2a6136779d74f178dcb2b438e01274a
msgid ""
"UniKT 默认集成 [SwanLab](https://swanlab.cn/) 作为轻量级、开箱即用的实验追踪看板（同时兼容 Weights "
"& Biases）。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT integrates [SwanLab](https://swanlab.cn/) by default as an out-of-"
"the-box experiment dashboard (also compatible with Weights & Biases)."

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:24
#: 9f65a69006fd499b93a8a06d585a7f2a
msgid "1. 云端追踪模式"
msgstr "1\\. Cloud Tracking Mode"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:26
#: b3a6b1ac4d144de697253124ace82062
msgid "在 `.env` 文件中填入你的凭据信息："
msgstr "Fill in your credentials in `.env`:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:28
#: b0b3a29e840543218dcd2d828ede9277
msgid ""
"# .env 文件配置\n"
"SWANLAB_MODE=cloud\n"
"SWANLAB_API_KEY=your_swanlab_api_key_here\n"
"KT_SWANLAB_WORKSPACE=your_workspace_name\n"
"KT_SWANLAB_PROJECT=UniKT\n"
"\n"
"# 可选：飞书/Lark 实验通知机器人 Webhook\n"
"LARK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/bot/v2/hook/xxxxxx\n"
"LARK_SECRET=your_lark_secret_if_any\n"
msgstr ""
"# .env configuration\n"
"SWANLAB_MODE=cloud\n"
"SWANLAB_API_KEY=your_swanlab_api_key_here\n"
"KT_SWANLAB_WORKSPACE=your_workspace_name\n"
"KT_SWANLAB_PROJECT=UniKT\n"
"\n"
"# Optional: Feishu/Lark training alert bot Webhook\n"
"LARK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/bot/v2/hook/xxxxxx\n"
"LARK_SECRET=your_lark_secret_if_any\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:40
#: 41fcee7095e346b4a88a1cb67f33e6f6
msgid "首次使用时，也可以在终端运行一键登录："
msgstr "When using SwanLab for the first time, you can also log in via terminal:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:41
#: 4af62961c0ba4447b215853a04fec7dd
msgid "swanlab login\n"
msgstr "swanlab login\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:45
#: 972c74473cf146089742d264800615b7
msgid "启动训练后，控制台将输出 SwanLab 实验看板链接："
msgstr ""
"Upon launching training, the console outputs the SwanLab experiment "
"dashboard URL:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:46
#: 7b96c544158440a6b2919a2dd0ffa879
msgid ""
"swanlab: Tracking run: https://swanlab.cn/@my-workspace/UniKT-"
"Experiments/runs/run-20261109_120000\n"
msgstr ""
"swanlab: Tracking run: https://swanlab.cn/@my-workspace/UniKT-"
"Experiments/runs/run-20261109_120000\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:50
#: 6c4a5f00dcec4b0db58a7ecb5e59a2b1
msgid "2. 本地离线模式"
msgstr "2\\. Local Offline Mode"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:52
#: f6cf3ca065e948948cd97ccc91bb4f84
msgid "在无外网连接的集群服务器或保密计算环境中，可切换为本地模式。训练数据将仅保存在本机的 `swanlog/` 目录下，不向外网发送任何数据："
msgstr ""
"In offline cluster environments or air-gapped systems, switch to local "
"mode. Metrics are recorded only in the local `swanlog/` directory, with "
"no data sent over the network:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:54
#: a448d029922947dfb196ac1e435ebd6b
msgid ""
"# 在 .env 中修改\n"
"SWANLAB_MODE=local\n"
msgstr ""
"# Modify in .env\n"
"SWANLAB_MODE=local\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:59
#: ac369db346ff40fbbf8e375782f863d1
msgid "启动本地看板服务查看历史实验："
msgstr "Launch the local dashboard server to view experiment histories:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:60
#: 6a2ffb551e304943b56b9f07d2f83f98
msgid "swanlab watch swanlog\n"
msgstr "swanlab watch swanlog\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:63
#: f9f435e2e6b94460a4b7dde2af446664
msgid "在浏览器中打开 `http://localhost:5092` 即可浏览本地所有训练曲线。"
msgstr ""
"Open `http://localhost:5092` in a browser to explore all local training "
"curves."

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:65
#: b068ff94fc3d4c799971be38be0a3fd8
msgid "3. 完全禁用云端追踪"
msgstr "3\\. Completely Disable Cloud Telemetry"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:67
#: 35ba1451fc964b3691ba38b749788573
msgid ""
"如果仅需要本地控制台输出与 CSV 文件记录，可以在命令行中通过 `--general.cloud_tracking false` "
"完全关闭指标上报器："
msgstr ""
"If you only require console outputs and CSV logs, disable cloud tracking "
"via `--general.cloud_tracking false` on the CLI:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:69
#: d77888e92643457da36a6147287887c1
msgid "python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --general.cloud_tracking false\n"
msgstr "python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --general.cloud_tracking false\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:73
#: deda9ebacf8e4f0881646031906a6dab
msgid "4. 切换为 Weights & Biases"
msgstr "4\\. Switch to Weights & Biases"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:75
#: d519e35463794306bad5a2cac46e1f7e
msgid "若团队习惯使用 W&B，可通过环境变量轻松切换："
msgstr ""
"If your team prefers W&B, switch tracking backends via environment "
"variables:"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:77
#: 93b5ce8faae244c5b656ca7fa4fc52e9
msgid ""
"# 在 .env 中配置\n"
"KT_TRACKING_BACKEND=wandb\n"
"KT_WANDB_PROJECT=UniKT\n"
"KT_WANDB_ENTITY=your_team\n"
msgstr ""
"# Configure in .env\n"
"KT_TRACKING_BACKEND=wandb\n"
"KT_WANDB_PROJECT=UniKT\n"
"KT_WANDB_ENTITY=your_team\n"

