#: 3368b0b01ba541558f23c439e3a80d78
msgid ""
"为了兼顾网络吞吐与训练效率，UniKT "
"默认采用异步指标上报器（`METRIC_LOGGING_ASYNC=1`），在独立的后台线程中提交网络请求，不阻塞 GPU 反向传播与前向计算。"
msgstr ""
"To balance network throughput and training efficiency, UniKT defaults to "
"asynchronous logging (`METRIC_LOGGING_ASYNC=1`), dispatching requests on "
"a background thread without stalling GPU execution."

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:100
#: 7595f9f709a1495a945f4e96e5336eb3
msgid "实验归档产物"
msgstr "Experiment Archive Artifacts"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:102
#: 390b011949e349198f923fab547f2e6d
msgid "任何一次训练（无论是常规训练、超参数搜索还是多折评估）结束时，都会在指定的 `runs/` 目录下落盘一套自包含的归档文件。"
msgstr ""
"Whenever training terminates (regular runs, hyperparameter sweeps, or "
"K-fold evaluations), a self-contained archive is written to `runs/`."

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:104
#: 23f210b2cb2044ef9d354ed4b7379a21
msgid ""
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128/\n"
"├── run_config.yaml         # 完整的静态配置快照\n"
"├── run_metadata.yaml       # 动态运行时元数据\n"
"├── metrics_train.csv       # 训练集指标历史\n"
"├── metrics_val.csv         # 验证集指标历史\n"
"├── metrics_test.csv        # 测试集最终指标\n"
"├── best_model.pth          # 最优模型权重\n"
"└── run.log                 # 完整控制台日志\n"
msgstr ""
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128/\n"
"├── run_config.yaml         # Complete static configuration snapshot\n"
"├── run_metadata.yaml       # Dynamic runtime metadata\n"
"├── metrics_train.csv       # Training metric history\n"
"├── metrics_val.csv         # Validation metric history\n"
"├── metrics_test.csv        # Test set final metrics\n"
"├── best_model.pth          # Best model weights\n"
"└── run.log                 # Complete console log\n"

#: ../../source/user-guides/experiment-tracking.md:115
